{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّآ", "translation": "Indeed We"}, {"text": "أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ", "translation": "[We] have sent you"}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ", "translation": "with the truth"}, {"text": "بَشِيرًۭا", "translation": "(as) a bearer of good news"}, {"text": "وَنَذِيرًۭا ۖ", "translation": "and (as) a warner"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "تُسْـَٔلُ", "translation": "you will be asked"}, {"text": "عَنْ", "translation": "about"}, {"text": "أَصْحَـٰبِ", "translation": "(the) companions"}, {"text": "ٱلْجَحِيمِ", "translation": "(of) the blazing Fire"}], "sahih": "Indeed, We have sent you, [O Muḥammad], with the truth as a bringer of good tidings and a warner, and you will not be asked about the companions of Hellfire."}